<div class="gap-bottom-equal edu-about-area about-style-9" style="background:#0060ff2e; padding: 60px 10px;">
    <div class="container edublink-animated-shape">
        <div class="row g-5 align-items-center">

            <div class="col-lg-8">
                <div class="about-content">
                    <div class="section-title section-left sal-animate" data-sal-delay="150" data-sal="slide-up" data-sal-duration="800">

                        <h2 class="title">Why Choose Singapore for Study?</h2>
                        <span class="shape-line"><i class="icon-19"></i></span>

                    </div>
                    <ul class="features-list sal-animate" data-sal-delay="150" data-sal="slide-up" data-sal-duration="800">
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            World-Class Academic Excellence
                            <p class="fs-5">Singapore’s universities are consistently ranked among the best globally, known for rigorous academics and innovative research. Graduates are highly respected and sought after by employers worldwide.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Strong Industry Connections
                            <p class="fs-5">Many multinational companies have their Asian headquarters and R&D centers in Singapore, offering students direct access to internships and job opportunities. This close industry-academia link enhances employability and practical skills.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Vibrant Multicultural Society
                            <p class="fs-5">Singapore is a harmonious blend of cultures, religions, and ethnicities, making it easy for international students to feel at home. English is widely spoken, ensuring smooth communication and integration.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Exceptional Quality of Life
                            <p class="fs-5">The city offers modern infrastructure, efficient public transport, and a clean, green environment. Students enjoy a rich cultural scene, diverse cuisine, and a safe, comfortable lifestyle.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Experiential and Holistic Learning
                            <p class="fs-5">Learning extends beyond the classroom with hands-on projects, industry collaborations, and community involvement. This approach equips students with real-world skills and personal growth.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Safe and Secure Environment
                            <p class="fs-5">Singapore is one of the world’s safest cities, with low crime rates and stable governance. Students and their families can enjoy peace of mind throughout their stay.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Gateway to Asia and Beyond
                            <p class="fs-5">Strategically located, Singapore is a travel hub with easy access to neighboring Asian countries. Students can explore new cultures and expand their global networks.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Supportive Student Services and Opportunities
                            <p class="fs-5"> Universities provide extensive support, from orientation to career counseling and scholarships. This ensures international students have the resources needed for academic and personal success.</p>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-lg-4">
                <img src="~/assets/images/Singapore/singapore-2.webp" style="border-radius: 5px; box-shadow: 2px 2px 2px #6d6d6d;" alt="Study Abroad Singapore" title="Study Abroad Singapore" loading="lazy" />
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>
</div>







